\newlabel{tab:bootstrap}{{11}{9}{Bootstrap 95\% CIs for pre-commitment FPR. The HS vs text comparison reaches significance on r1-32b ($p=0.034$) but not on QwQ-32B ($p=0.218$)}{table.caption.15}{}}
